      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROMPT (~3k tokens): rules ('answer only from the sources, cite them,\nsay I don't know') + summary + last turns + the 5 chunks + the question.\nFirst token in ~1.5 s: rewrite 0.3 + embed 0.05 + search/rerank 0.3 + LLM 0.8.\nINGEST: unchanged file (same hash) -> skip; changed -> re-chunk + re-embed\nonly that doc; permission change -> patch metadata, no re-embedding.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PROMPT (~3k tokens): rules ('answer only from the sources, cite them,\nsay I don't know') + summary + last turns + the 5 chunks + the question.\nFirst token in ~1.5 s: rewrite 0.3 + embed 0.05 + search/rerank 0.3 + LLM 0.8.\nINGEST: unchanged file (same hash) -> skip; changed -> re-chunk + re-embed\nonly that doc; permission change -> patch metadata, no re-embedding.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
